name 'aif-y2-ai-at-scale-preassessment-q10-2026'

wrong 'The system uses training data from past emergency room stays.'
wrong 'The system was built by a team of engineers in collaboration with a doctor.'
wrong 'The system is a neural network with three layers, and the hidden layer has 1,024 neurons.'
right 'The system is less accurate for patients of one gender than another.'

